<speak version="1.0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2001/10/synthesis" xml:lang="en-US"><voice name="en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural">Number sixteen.<break time="1150ms"/></voice><voice name="en-US-AriaNeural">During her first weeks at a design company, Nina tried to write down every comment made during team meetings.<break time="180ms"/> She often missed later points because she was still writing.<break time="180ms"/> A colleague showed her how to divide a page into decisions and tasks.<break time="180ms"/> Nina used the new format at the next meeting and found it easier to follow the discussion.<break time="1100ms"/></voice><voice name="en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural">Question.<break time="350ms"/></voice><voice name="en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural">Why did Nina change how she took notes?</voice></speak>
